  "schema:name": "Chalkline: California educator credential authorizations as CTDL",
  "dct:title": "Chalkline: California educator credential authorizations as CTDL",
  "schema:description": "Unofficial demonstration. Chalkline is not published by, affiliated with, or endorsed by the California Commission on Teacher Credentialing or by Credential Engine. It models information the Commission publishes on its public Authorization Sort Table, to show what a machine-readable representation of California educator credentials could look like. Nothing here has been published to the Credential Registry, and these CTIDs are not Registry-assigned.",
